  "prefLabel": "Pda 101.26 Pier",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 101.26 “Pier” means a structure extending into the water from a shore or bank or along a shore or bank which provides for the transfer of cargo or passengers or the berthing for ships, and includes but is not limited to, wharves, quays and docks.\n\nSource. #8760, eff 11-18-06 (formerly Pda 101.18)",
